# Mention and tag names (C2-I-092, CC-1634 to CC-1640).

Tag #café and #cafe here, #größe.
#   ^^^^^ -constant.other.symbol.tag.carve
#             ^^^^^ constant.other.symbol.tag.carve
#                         ^^^^^^ -constant.other.symbol.tag.carve

The mention @josé and @jose.
#           ^^^^^ -constant.other.symbol.mention.carve
#                     ^^^^^ constant.other.symbol.mention.carve

A #tag- x and #tag-é and #tag.é.
# ^^^^ constant.other.symbol.tag.carve
#     ^ -constant.other.symbol.tag.carve
#             ^^^^^^ -constant.other.symbol.tag.carve
#                        ^^^^^^ -constant.other.symbol.tag.carve

Dotted @a.b. and #a.b. names.
#      ^^^^ constant.other.symbol.mention.carve
#          ^ -constant.other.symbol.mention.carve
#                ^^^^ constant.other.symbol.tag.carve
#                    ^ -constant.other.symbol.tag.carve

An emoji ends it: #tag😀 and #1 is text.
#                 ^^^^ constant.other.symbol.tag.carve
#                            ^^ -constant.other.symbol.tag.carve

